1
00:01:46,522 --> 00:01:47,813
怎么回事?
What's going on?

2
00:01:48,313 --> 00:01:49,813
擎天的供暖也停了吗?
Is the heat off in Atlas too?

3
00:01:50,772 --> 00:01:52,647
他们不会就这么停止供暖..
They wouldn't just turn the heat off...

4
00:01:54,188 --> 00:01:54,897
...会吗?
...would they?

5
00:01:58,772 --> 00:02:02,730
将军 从你当上校长开始
General, since the day you were appointed Headmaster,

6
00:02:02,772 --> 00:02:08,147
就有擎天人质疑一个人在议会占两席这一现状
there have been Atlesians who are skeptical of one man holding two Council seats.

7
00:02:08,313 --> 00:02:11,397
没错 所以我们确保能制衡这点
Yes, which is exactly why we have checks and balances.

8
00:02:11,438 --> 00:02:15,480
制衡本应存在 但最近你简直跨过我们为所欲为啊
We're supposed to, but lately you've been running roughshod all over them,

9
00:02:15,522 --> 00:02:17,688
单方面做出各种决定
making unilateral decisions without us.

10
00:02:17,730 --> 00:02:19,313
议员 我从未试图
Councilman, I never intended-

11
00:02:19,355 --> 00:02:23,313
人们总是口是心非啊将军
What people intend and what they do aren't always the same, General.

12
00:02:24,938 --> 00:02:25,188
什么?
What?

13
00:02:25,813 --> 00:02:26,563
多久了?
For how long?

14
00:02:28,022 --> 00:02:29,063
我的授权?
My authorization?

15
00:02:29,105 --> 00:02:29,897
赶紧复查!
Check it again!

16
00:02:32,522 --> 00:02:33,813
雪倪议员?
Councilman Schnee?

17
00:02:34,188 --> 00:02:38,563
没错 我同意一切 同意你们刚刚所说的
Yes, I agree with everything, everything that was just said.

18
00:02:39,022 --> 00:02:41,188
没 呃 没有进一步的问题了
No, uh, no further questions.

19
00:02:42,730 --> 00:02:44,897
我还没说完
I'm not quite done yet.

20
00:02:45,230 --> 00:02:48,230
你在害怕什么东西 不是吗 将军?
You're afraid of something, General. Aren't you?

21
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:50,355
我想这很明显 修小姐
I think that's pretty obvious, Miss Hill.

22
00:02:51,022 --> 00:02:54,897
我在防范擎天变成下一个信标或避风港
I'm trying to prevent Atlas from becoming another Beacon, another Haven.

23
00:02:55,188 --> 00:02:57,563
而你却不相信你自己的议会来帮你?
Yet, you don't trust your own Council to help you?

24
00:02:57,730 --> 00:02:59,105
秘密行动?
Operating in secret?

25
00:02:59,605 --> 00:03:02,522
这都是有所隐瞒的表现
These are the actions of somebody who's hiding something.

26
00:03:03,397 --> 00:03:04,980
我没有隐瞒任何事
I'm not hiding anything.

27
00:03:05,272 --> 00:03:06,980
那我们就来试试吧
Let's put it to the test then.

28
00:03:09,605 --> 00:03:11,730
你们都听说过我的外像力
You're all aware of my Semblance.

29
00:03:12,397 --> 00:03:15,647
让我们此时此刻解决吧 埃隆伍德将军
Let's settle it here and now, General Ironwood.

30
00:03:20,397 --> 00:03:21,938
马上
Here and now.

31
00:03:25,022 --> 00:03:26,105
等等!
Wait!

32
00:03:26,772 --> 00:03:28,688
你们问责错人了
You've got the wrong man on trial.

33
00:03:29,313 --> 00:03:31,230
我知道谁在陷害埃隆伍德
I know who's been framing Ironwood,

34
00:03:31,272 --> 00:03:35,188
谁在操控选举 而且我父亲也参与了
who rigged the election. And my father does, too.

35
00:03:35,855 --> 00:03:37,188
他在与这人合作
He's been working with him.

36
00:03:39,647 --> 00:03:42,105
这不是亚瑟·瓦特吗?
Is that Arthur Watts?

37
00:03:42,147 --> 00:03:43,188
不可能!
That's impossible!

38
00:03:43,355 --> 00:03:45,938
瓦特博士几年前就死于圣骑士事件了
Dr. Watts died in the Paladin Incident years ago.

39
00:03:47,063 --> 00:03:48,397
这是什么?
What is this?

40
00:03:52,813 --> 00:03:53,522
播放它
Play it.

41
00:03:56,022 --> 00:03:59,563
禁运以来那混蛋每天都让我损失更多钱
That bastard is costing me more money every day with this embargo.

42
00:04:00,230 --> 00:04:04,980
要不是为了这该死的选票 我早就把曼特的雇员全裁了
Pd lay off every employee in Mantle it' wasn't trying to get their damn votes for this Council seat!

43
00:04:05,397 --> 00:04:10,438
如果我说你能鱼与熊掌兼得呢?
What if I said you could have your cake and eat it, too?

44
00:04:11,438 --> 00:04:13,105
你有什么主意
What did you have in mind?

45
00:04:13,397 --> 00:04:16,397
詹姆斯‧埃隆伍德从来没赏识我的才华
James Ironwood never recognized my genius.

46
00:04:16,438 --> 00:04:19,522
我为他付出那么多他却贬谪了我
After everything I gave him, he still disgraced me.

47
00:04:19,897 --> 00:04:23,272
我只是想报答这一切
I simply wish to return the favor.

48
00:04:24,563 --> 00:04:26,105
我有什么好处
What's in it for me?

49
00:04:26,688 --> 00:04:28,272
议员席位
A seat on the council.

50
00:04:28,855 --> 00:04:32,522
而我所需要的只是你的擎天网络访问权限
All I need is your login credentials to the Atlas network.

51
00:04:32,563 --> 00:04:35,772
你答应让埃隆伍德的人生变成噩梦
You promise to make Ironwood's life a waking nightmare,

52
00:04:36,147 --> 00:04:43,480
而我则给曼特的选民一点‘数字波动’保证让你赢得民选
and I will guarantee you victory at the polls by giving the voters down in Mantle a little.., 'digital push', fyou will!

53
00:04:44,397 --> 00:04:51,272
我一直知道你是个厉害的科学家 亚瑟 但我从不知道你是那么好的推销员
I always knew you were a good scientist, Arthur, but I never knew you were such a good salesman.

54
00:04:51,522 --> 00:04:53,397
够了
Enough.

55
00:04:55,647 --> 00:04:59,272
这 这是 我能解释的
That, that is -- I can explain that.

56
00:05:00,855 --> 00:05:03,188
这...不是真的
That... isn't real.

57
00:05:03,688 --> 00:05:06,438
杰克 坐下
Jacques, take your seat.

58
00:05:13,438 --> 00:05:14,480
Weiss
Weiss...

59
00:05:14,813 --> 00:05:17,522
杰克·雪倪 你被捕了
Jacques Schnee, you're under arrest.

60
00:05:19,647 --> 00:05:20,730
我能这么做吗?
Can I do that?

61
00:05:32,230 --> 00:05:34,897
擎天故意关掉了供暖
Atlas killed the heat on purpose

62
00:05:35,438 --> 00:05:37,563
他们为了控制我们什么事都做得出来
They'll do anything to control us.

63
00:05:40,980 --> 00:05:44,605
情况失控了 请求指示
The situation here is getting out of control. Please advise.

64
00:05:55,563 --> 00:05:58,147
我知道你会为了自私的目的放低姿态
I knew you'd stoop low to get what you wanted, Jacques!

65
00:05:58,772 --> 00:05:59,647
但这?
But this?

66
00:05:59,855 --> 00:06:02,355
这不过是个大飞跃 詹姆斯
This is all a great leap, James.

67
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:04,688
不 这其实很简单
No, it's quite simple really --

68
00:06:04,730 --> 00:06:06,688
现在我既然知道亚瑟·瓦特还活着
now that I know Arthur Watts is alive.

69
00:06:06,897 --> 00:06:09,272
还与提利安·卡洛斯这种疯子合作
Working with a madman like Tyrian Callows,

70
00:06:09,563 --> 00:06:16,063
那么对他而言 策划出其不意的仓库惨剧就很容易了
it would be easy for someone like him to coordinate an unthinkably heinous act like the one in that warehouse.

71
00:06:16,438 --> 00:06:18,647
瓦特设计了整个曼特的安保网络
Watts designed Mantle's entire security network.

72
00:06:18,688 --> 00:06:24,063
他利用这来黑进监视设备并嫁祸他人
He used that access to hack the surveillance system and frame someone else for the job.

73
00:06:28,813 --> 00:06:30,730
同时又操纵选举
All while stealing an election.

74
00:06:32,188 --> 00:06:38,397
然后你一成为议员 你的新权限就给了他进入擎天安保网络的后门
And once you became a Councilman, your newly granted clearance gave him a backdoor into Allas secure network.

75
00:06:39,230 --> 00:06:41,980
但你也没有考虑过后果 对吧
But you probably hadn't even considered that, had you?

76
00:06:42,855 --> 00:06:47,147
那晚死掉的人 血债在你手上
The people that died that night, their blood is on your hands.

77
00:06:47,522 --> 00:06:52,772
杰克·雪倪必须接受审判 罪名不仅仅是叛国 还有协助谋杀
Jacques Schnee must be tried, not only for treason, but as an accessory to murder.

78
00:06:52,980 --> 00:06:54,855
这些指控不可容忍
These are outrageous accusations.

79
00:06:55,147 --> 00:06:57,188
我只是想赢得选举
I only intended to win the election.

80
00:06:57,230 --> 00:06:58,272
我与这无关
I had nothing to do--

81
00:06:58,313 --> 00:06:59,897
只是?!
Only?!

82
00:07:04,813 --> 00:07:08,105
杰克给他的权限还能用来做什么?
What else will he be able to do with the access Jacques' given him?

83
00:07:08,147 --> 00:07:12,022
有了足够的时间... 他能做想做的一切
With enough time .. whatever he wants.

84
00:07:18,938 --> 00:07:21,022
等等 什么?
Wait... wait, what?

85
00:07:21,230 --> 00:07:23,355
你是说供暖被关闭了?
What do you mean the heat has gone off?

86
00:07:23,522 --> 00:07:26,938
你得相信我 我不知道他在策划这些事情
You have to believe me, I didn't know he was planning this.

87
00:07:27,230 --> 00:07:32,480
你他丫给我闭嘴 然后去让供暖系统重新上线
You are going to shut your mouth and get the heating grid up and running again.

88
00:07:32,688 --> 00:07:38,938
我... 我已经被告知 我们没法进入系统
I... I've been informed that we can't get into the system.

89
00:07:39,022 --> 00:07:41,522
它... 它被封锁了
It's... It's been blocked off.

90
00:07:43,147 --> 00:07:44,897
没有暖气
Without heat down there...

91
00:07:46,772 --> 00:07:48,272
下面的人们会死的
people are going to die.

92
00:07:51,438 --> 00:07:52,647
埃隆伍德将军
General Ironwood?

93
00:07:53,772 --> 00:07:54,813
有多糟?
How bad is it?

94
00:07:56,272 --> 00:07:57,980
他在使用杰克的证书
He's using Jacques' credentials.

95
00:07:58,397 --> 00:08:00,397
我们可以以此网络追踪他
We can follow that activity on the network.

96
00:08:00,730 --> 00:08:02,730
如果他找到路径进入阿米特系统...
If he's found his way into the Amity system...

97
00:08:04,605 --> 00:08:08,688
不 那秘密是安全的 暂时是
No, the secret is safe. For now.

98
00:08:09,355 --> 00:08:14,438
但如果他知道了阿米特 她就会知道阿米特
But if he learns about Amity, she learns about Amity.

99
00:08:14,938 --> 00:08:16,313
你能拦截访问吗?
Can you block his access?

100
00:08:16,438 --> 00:08:17,438
太迟了
It's too late.

101
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,147
他已经开始将我们封锁在系统外了
He's already starting to lock us out.

102
00:08:19,313 --> 00:08:20,688
有办法追踪他吗?
an we trace him somehow

103
00:08:20,897 --> 00:08:21,855
找到他的藏身处?
Find out where he's hiding?

104
00:08:22,105 --> 00:08:23,313
他会一直移动
He's going to be mobile.

105
00:08:23,605 --> 00:08:25,022
我们需要找到他的接入点
We need his access point.

106
00:08:25,230 --> 00:08:26,897
我们需要他在明处
We need to get him out in the open.

107
00:08:26,938 --> 00:08:29,438
好吧 让我捋一捋情况
Okay, so let me get this straight.

108
00:08:30,063 --> 00:08:32,272
是的 我还在
Yep, still here everyone.

109
00:08:32,813 --> 00:08:37,105
一个丢尽颜面的科学家跟一个失踪多年的杀人狂是怎么搞到一起去的 将军?
How do a disgraced scientist and disappeared serial killer find each other, General?

110
00:08:37,563 --> 00:08:38,897
他们为何要针对你?
Why would they target you?

111
00:08:39,230 --> 00:08:41,355
而你又为什么如此大费周章的
And why are you working so hard

112
00:08:41,397 --> 00:08:43,772
去对他们隐瞒阿米特通讯塔的事?
to hide the Amity Communications Tower from them?

113
00:08:45,397 --> 00:08:46,230
你知道了?
You know?

114
00:08:53,522 --> 00:08:57,188
市民们 请分散
Citizens, please disperse.

115
00:08:57,480 --> 00:09:00,563
为了您的自身安全 请分散
For your own safety, please disperse.

116
00:09:00,855 --> 00:09:03,147
为了您的自身安全 请--
For your own safety, please --

117
00:09:19,022 --> 00:09:20,397
擎天 这里是曼特Delta小队
Atlas, Manta Team Delta --

118
00:09:20,522 --> 00:09:21,480
初轮攻击开始
beginning first run.

119
00:09:48,188 --> 00:09:51,063
我曾以为你藏着秘密是为了保全自己
I used to think you were hiding something to protect yourself.

120
00:09:51,605 --> 00:09:53,855
我能感觉到这背后有更大的意义
But I can tell there's something much bigger going on here.

121
00:09:55,188 --> 00:09:57,230
现在 我觉得你是为了保护别的东西
Now I think it's to protect something else.

122
00:09:57,772 --> 00:10:01,355
我们 擎天 甚至是整个树不子
Us... Atlas, maybe even all of Remnant.

123
00:10:01,813 --> 00:10:04,313
你害怕说出了事实之后可能会发生的事
And you're afraid of what might happen if you tell the truth.

124
00:10:07,897 --> 00:10:10,605
将军 曼特城里到处都是戮兽
General, the Grimm are all over Mantle.

125
00:10:11,563 --> 00:10:13,272
空中小队已经尽力了
The air fleet's doing everything they can,

126
00:10:13,397 --> 00:10:15,397
但他们无法轻易锁定戮兽
but they can't easily target Grimm in the city

127
00:10:15,438 --> 00:10:16,772
那样可能会伤及无辜
without risking casualties.

128
00:10:18,230 --> 00:10:22,730
这 就是我害怕会发生的事
This -- this is what I was afraid would happen.

129
00:10:24,563 --> 00:10:27,022
长官 我们需要陆地支援
Sir, we need ground support now.

130
00:10:27,188 --> 00:10:29,855
我们需要做的是疏散曼特城的人民
What we need is to start evacuating Mantle.

131
00:10:29,980 --> 00:10:31,355
如果整个城市被侵占
If it's completely overrun,

132
00:10:31,397 --> 00:10:32,938
哪里都不安全
it's not going to be safe anywhere.

133
00:10:32,980 --> 00:10:34,022
可以让舰队去--
Use the fleet to get -

134
00:10:34,063 --> 00:10:36,022
如果我让舰队去了 擎天将变得不堪一击
If I move the fleet, then Atlas is vulnerable.

135
00:10:37,022 --> 00:10:42,272
我 我尝试保护王国的安全
I... I tried to keep the kingdom safe.

136
00:10:43,022 --> 00:10:44,730
但现在我们却输掉了一切
And now we're losing everything.

137
00:10:48,813 --> 00:10:49,438
将军?
General?

138
00:10:50,730 --> 00:10:52,938
您早些时候问我要了建议
Earlier, you asked for my advice.

139
00:10:54,105 --> 00:10:55,688
我想要的是奥兹平的建议
I wanted Ozpin's advice.

140
00:10:55,730 --> 00:10:57,480
他的建议或许会是
And his advice probably would've been

141
00:10:57,522 --> 00:10:58,605
让您保守秘密
to keep your secrets.

142
00:10:59,188 --> 00:11:00,188
当我们到来时
When we first got here,

143
00:11:00,230 --> 00:11:01,855
您就知道那不是正确的路
you already knew that wasn't the right course.

144
00:11:02,688 --> 00:11:03,605
您有了新的计划
You had a new plan.

145
00:11:04,522 --> 00:11:06,188
是时候放弃那个计划了
It's time to give up on that plan.

146
00:11:07,105 --> 00:11:08,480
一切都被瓦解了
It's all falling apart.

147
00:11:08,730 --> 00:11:09,813
您曾担心会发生的恐慌?
The panic you were worried about?

148
00:11:09,855 --> 00:11:10,897
已经在发生了
It's already happening.

149
00:11:11,438 --> 00:11:12,688
您隐瞒的那些事情?
The secrets you're keeping?

150
00:11:12,730 --> 00:11:14,355
也都快被公之于众了
They're about to be in the open anyway.

151
00:11:15,230 --> 00:11:16,230
是时候了
It's time.

152
00:11:18,147 --> 00:11:19,063
告诉他们真相
Tell the truth.

153
00:11:20,272 --> 00:11:21,313
你不是一个人
You're not alone.

154
00:11:23,730 --> 00:11:25,230
我们可以一起做
We can do this together.

155
00:11:29,188 --> 00:11:30,188
谢谢
Thank you.

156
00:11:31,147 --> 00:11:34,355
奥斯卡 我想你最好回到学院
Oscar, I think it's time you get back to the academy.

157
00:11:35,063 --> 00:11:36,105
我想您是对的
I think you're right.

158
00:11:36,688 --> 00:11:39,688
修小姐 斯立特议员 卡米拉议员
Miss Hill, Councilman Sleet, Councilwoman Camilla,

159
00:11:40,563 --> 00:11:42,813
有一些事情你们需要知道
there are some things you need to know about.

160
00:11:43,647 --> 00:11:46,855
来想想我们能如何一起帮助曼特城吧
Let's figure out how we can help Mantle... together.

161
00:11:47,688 --> 00:11:49,063
我叫了运输机
I've called a transport.

162
00:11:49,105 --> 00:11:50,605
瓦特和提利安怎么办?
What about Watts and Tyrian?

163
00:11:50,647 --> 00:11:52,147
让我来解决
You leave them to me.

164
00:11:52,563 --> 00:11:54,147
你们现在需要下到城里去
Right now, you're needed down below.

165
00:11:54,605 --> 00:11:57,772
好了各位 是时候去做我们的本职工作了
Alright everybody, it's time to do our jobs.

166
00:11:58,563 --> 00:11:59,772
所有人
All of us.

167
00:12:02,230 --> 00:12:03,147
如她所说
What she said.

168
00:12:03,605 --> 00:12:04,938
该去实现计划了 猎人们
Let's make it happen, Huntsmen.

169
00:12:16,438 --> 00:12:16,980
奥斯卡?
Oscar?

170
00:12:17,355 --> 00:12:17,605
我
|--

171
00:12:17,855 --> 00:12:18,647
噢 你先说吧
Oh, you first.

172
00:12:18,688 --> 00:12:19,022
抱歉
Sorry.

173
00:12:19,063 --> 00:12:19,855
我没想打扰你
I didn't mean to interrupt --

174
00:12:19,897 --> 00:12:20,397
你并没有
You didn't, actually.

175
00:12:20,438 --> 00:12:21,438
我只是想说
Pjust wanted to say -

176
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:22,272
我在想或许
I had the thought that maybe

177
00:12:23,022 --> 00:12:24,063
我们应该告诉埃隆伍德
We should tell Ironwood.

178
00:12:26,980 --> 00:12:29,063
我们想到一起去了?
I guess we're on the same page, huh?

179
00:12:29,522 --> 00:12:30,230
大概是吧
Guess so.

180
00:12:32,230 --> 00:12:34,438
他终于战胜恐惧 选择了说出真相
He's finally choosing the truth over fear.

181
00:12:35,022 --> 00:12:35,813
我想我们也该一样
We should do the same.

182
00:12:36,230 --> 00:12:37,063
我去告诉他
I'll tell him.

183
00:12:37,688 --> 00:12:40,313
开始就是我决定对他隐瞒的
I'm the one who chose to keep it from him in the first place.

184
00:12:40,355 --> 00:12:40,813
Ruby!
Ruby!

185
00:12:41,563 --> 00:12:42,813
运输机要走了
Transport's leaving.

186
00:12:43,563 --> 00:12:45,230
我想有其他地方更需要你
I think you're needed elsewhere.

187
00:12:46,313 --> 00:12:46,855
你确定吗?
You're sure?

188
00:12:47,647 --> 00:12:49,147
嗯 我没问题的
Yeah, I've got it.

189
00:12:51,980 --> 00:12:53,147
祝你好运
Good luck in there.

190
00:12:55,647 --> 00:12:57,272
呕 小屁孩
Ugh, kids.

191
00:13:03,105 --> 00:13:04,105
好了 各位
All right, everyone.

192
00:13:04,938 --> 00:13:07,480
我需要对我们的新猎人们特别说一下
I need to stress to our new Huntsmen and Huntresses,

193
00:13:07,688 --> 00:13:10,897
在解决戮兽前 我们要优先人民的安全
we are prioritizing citizen safety over killing Grimm.

194
00:13:11,230 --> 00:13:11,813
明白了吗?
Got it?

195
00:13:33,188 --> 00:13:34,772
她能控制戮兽?
She can control Grimm?

196
00:13:35,063 --> 00:13:37,480
埃隆伍德不会撒这种谎
Ironwood wouldn't lie about something like this.

197
00:13:38,105 --> 00:13:39,688
你觉得他能阻止她吗?
you really think he can stop her?

198
00:13:43,980 --> 00:13:46,647
她 无法被杀
She... can't be killed.

199
00:13:47,813 --> 00:13:49,230
灯神告诉你的?
Jinn told you this?

200
00:13:49,563 --> 00:13:51,938
当我们问她奥兹隐瞒了什么的时候 她给我们看的
She showed us when we asked what Oz was hiding.

201
00:13:52,438 --> 00:13:53,147
为什么?
Why?

202
00:13:53,897 --> 00:13:55,855
奥兹为什么要对我们隐瞒这件事?
Why would Oz keep this from us?

203
00:13:56,522 --> 00:13:58,022
对信任他的人?
From the people who trusted him?

204
00:13:58,397 --> 00:14:00,230
他担心您会失去信心
He was worried you would lose hope.

205
00:14:03,230 --> 00:14:05,438
我们也很抱歉对您隐瞒了这件事
We're sorry we kept it from you, too.

206
00:14:06,105 --> 00:14:07,563
我们当时不知道能信任谁
We didn't know who to trust.

207
00:14:08,063 --> 00:14:13,022
我想您最好知道事实 在您做出任何牺牲前
I figured you should know before you make any... sacrifices.

208
00:14:15,813 --> 00:14:16,438
长官?
Sir?

209
00:14:18,772 --> 00:14:20,230
您打算怎么做?
What are you gonna do?

210
00:14:21,230 --> 00:14:22,022
我
I...

211
00:14:24,313 --> 00:14:25,688
我们现在能做的
All we can do for the moment

212
00:14:26,272 --> 00:14:27,938
就是拼尽全力保住曼特城
is what we can to save Mantle.

213
00:14:28,522 --> 00:14:29,938
这是我们眼前最紧迫的
That's what's in front of us.

214
00:14:31,522 --> 00:14:32,772
他会为您骄傲的
He'd be proud of you.

215
00:14:33,188 --> 00:14:35,897
您带来了擎天本该代表的希望
You're bringing the hope that Atlas was meant to inspire.

216
00:14:36,647 --> 00:14:39,063
空中之城该有更高的标准
A city in the sky is held to a higher standard.

217
00:14:41,022 --> 00:14:43,105
你说的好像你曾在那--
You say that like you were there --

218
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:46,522
我们的载具到了
Our transports are here.

219
00:14:47,230 --> 00:14:48,022
我们该走了
We should move.

220
00:14:53,438 --> 00:14:54,188
奥斯卡
Oscar.

221
00:14:57,147 --> 00:14:58,480
不要再有更多“惊喜”了 好吗?
No more surprises, all right?

222
00:14:59,522 --> 00:15:01,022
我不确定我还受不受得了
I'm not sure I could take it.

223
00:15:03,522 --> 00:15:04,522
你跟我都是
You and me both.

224
00:15:07,563 --> 00:15:09,105
抓紧了!
Hang on!

225
00:15:23,813 --> 00:15:25,522
我甩不开它!
I can't shake it!

226
00:15:31,105 --> 00:15:31,522
我想我们要掉下去了
I don't think we're staying airborne.

227
00:15:31,563 --> 00:15:32,522
I don't think we're staying airborne.

228
00:15:33,063 --> 00:15:34,063
该走了
It's time to go.

229
00:15:34,313 --> 00:15:35,855
你们的队伍都分配了任务
You have your team assignments.

230
00:15:37,855 --> 00:15:38,688
去吧
Let's go.

231
00:15:44,938 --> 00:15:47,230
哈里特 别呆太久
Harriet, don't stay too long.

232
00:15:47,272 --> 00:15:49,230
是啊 谢谢你的好建议
Yeah, thanks for the tip.

233
00:15:59,022 --> 00:16:00,730
跟紧了 小姑娘
Try to keep up, kid.

234
00:16:11,813 --> 00:16:13,480
爱炫技
Show off!

235
00:16:17,522 --> 00:16:18,647
你竟敢如此放肆?
How dare you?

236
00:16:19,938 --> 00:16:21,855
这是非常多余的做法
This is highly unnecessary.

237
00:16:22,022 --> 00:16:22,730
我不会忍的
I will not stand for this.

238
00:16:23,230 --> 00:16:24,772
不要那样碰我
Don't touch me like that

239
00:16:34,563 --> 00:16:36,272
我要举报这样粗鲁的对待
I'll be reporting this rough treatment.

240
00:16:37,313 --> 00:16:38,480
呵
Huh.

241
00:17:03,397 --> 00:17:05,022
你回来得倒挺早
You're back early.

242
00:17:06,647 --> 00:17:09,355
告诉我你找到了我们要找的东西
Tell me you found what we've been looking for.